6710760171535#custom-anchor-预算类型\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【附录-预算类型】</a>，可选值:<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">BUDGET_MODE_DAY（日预算）</code><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">BUDGET_MODE_INFINITE（不限）</code></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-L632tu1G\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-JlcFdVyU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tTsg2pjS\">request_id</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-OjviEYfi\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cODmtZ73\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-gBvnB7Py\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jU6FfwK9\">请求的日志id，唯一标识一个请求</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-l6EQfDJ8\" id=\"h6f20189-l6EQfDJ8\">应答示例</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-Nl36ybkf\"><br/></p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22HTTPS%2F1.1%20200%20OK%5Cn